# MerchSpring AI uses Firebase AI Logic for Gemini requests.
# Do NOT put a Gemini Developer API key in this Android project: values compiled
# into an APK can be extracted. Firebase AI Logic provides a server-side proxy.
#
# Setup:
# 1. Register the Android application in Firebase.
# 2. Enable Firebase AI Logic and configure App Check.
# 3. Download the Firebase Android configuration to app/google-services.json.
# 4. Register a debug App Check token in Firebase Console for local debugging.
#
# Never commit service-account private keys or App Check debug tokens.
